nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250310105359&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Enpa_Deia_Pema_85685f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Enpa-Deia Pema.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In a temple in <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Valley\">Blue Valley</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Pema holds the title of Enpa-Deia which means she will eventually succeed the Enpa. The Enpa is the spiritual guide and guardian of the Merudri, and is currently <a href=\"#/wiki/Enpa%20Rudra\">Enpa Rudra</a>. The Merudri's current home and central hub is Blue Valley because their predecessors were separated from their ancestral home and stranded in this realm.\n</p><p>She can heal you up to 65 hp and can also remove any harmful <a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Conditions\">Status Conditions</a>.\n</p><p>Ask her \"pilgrimage\" to start <a href=\"#/quest/the-way-of-the-monk-quest\">The Way of the Monk Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div